{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/intro.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>\u00a0Ghost Villa is a round based fps with tower defense and farming elements, you farm and build up your defenses during the day, by night you fight hordes of ghosts that want to haunt and take possession of your home.\u00a0Your crops will yield phantasmagoric vegetables that will grant you essential power ups to deal with the ghost invasion. Each night will bring forth more and tougher invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/plants.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Take care of a wide variety of crops, and sell the produce to buy better equipment and defense mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Phantasmagoric Crops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/crops.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Due to the excess of spectral energy in the farm your plants will yield special vegetables at night, eat them to gain all kinds of power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/build.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Build solar panels, turrets, water tanks, drones, and everything you need to keep your farm productive and safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fighting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/FightN.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Your specialized gun will allow you to absorb energy from ghosts and use their own energy against them, blast them, dash through walls, take cover among your turrets. Do what you must to protect your home!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902780?t=1747932218","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902780?t=1747932218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747932218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747932218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/intro.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>\u00a0Ghost Villa is a round based fps with tower defense and farming elements, you farm and build up your defenses during the day, by night you fight hordes of ghosts that want to haunt and take possession of your home.\u00a0Your crops will yield phantasmagoric vegetables that will grant you essential power ups to deal with the ghost invasion. Each night will bring forth more and tougher invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/plants.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Take care of a wide variety of crops, and sell the produce to buy better equipment and defense mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Phantasmagoric Crops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/crops.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Due to the excess of spectral energy in the farm your plants will yield special vegetables at night, eat them to gain all kinds of power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/build.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Build solar panels, turrets, water tanks, drones, and everything you need to keep your farm productive and safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fighting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/FightN.gif?t=1747932218\" /></div>Your specialized gun will allow you to absorb energy from ghosts and use their own energy against them, blast them, dash through walls, take cover among your turrets. Do what you must to protect your home!</p>","developers":["Claudio Norori"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/325072adb8a665a5893b7a0a5060f14b1f6c0c00/header.jpg?t=1747932218","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.9.3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 @ 2.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<stron